Use CSS media queries to adjust styles at different breakpoints. For example:

@media (max-width: 600px) {
  .container { flex-direction: column; }
}

Also consider using relative units like percentages, ems, or rems instead of fixed pixels for widths and margins.

Add media queries to your CSS. For instance:

@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .header { font-size: 1.2rem; }
}

